      'Time was also spent on smartphone features related to this remake. In the Nintendo Switch App you can use the Zelda Notes application to keep statistics from your playthrough, for example, and keep a kind of logbook of your adventure. With points you collect by completing certain tasks in the game, you can unlock songs that can then be played with the ocarina inside the app. It is also possible to make music yourself with the virtual instrument.',
      'How do we feel about the remake? Right after the Direct, Jacco and Cody dove into the recording room to give their opinion. The day after the Zelda Direct there was also a regular presentation full of Nintendo games. That one is also covered at length in the Bonuslevel podcast, but we still wonder a little whether this should not have been one presentation.',
      'Special console and concert series. During the Direct, special Nintendo products with a The Legend of Zelda theme were also revealed. The company is bringing a special edition of the Nintendo Switch 2 with Joy-Con, as well as a matching Pro Controller and carrying case. These products are available from 29 October.',
