      'How can you play the original Ocarina of Time on Nintendo Switch? The original Nintendo 64 version is available on Nintendo Switch through Nintendo Switch Online + Expansion Pack. You do not buy the game separately there, but play it as long as your subscription is active. In the Netherlands this pack also gives access to other classic Nintendo 64, Game Boy Advance, Sega Mega Drive and Virtual Boy games inside the Nintendo Switch Online library.',
