    title: 'Played: Mega Man Dual Override is mainly very approachable',
    excerpt:
      'Grand Theft Auto 6 will not bother Capcom much. The Japanese developer’s year cannot really go wrong anymore; it has shipped three excellent games so far. Resident Evil Requiem, Pragmata and Onimusha: Way of the Sword did well critically and financially, but what waits in 2027? The Blue Bomber. In Cologne we got a taste of Mega Man Dual Override.',
