    slug: 'review-wolverine-is-een-fantastisch-gemaakte-game-maar-geen-fantastische-game',
    title: 'Review: Wolverine is a fantastically made game, but not a fantastic game',
    excerpt:
      'Normally Wolverine should be a gimme. Sony’s own games are almost always scored high, the audience swallows them whole, superhero games are almost always a hit these days, and developer Insomniac has a reputation of years of nothing but hits. Past results offer no guarantees for the future, it turns out. Wolverine is anything but a fantastic game.',
    author,
